{
  "id": "2SA.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samuel 7",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when the king dwelt in his house, and Jehovah had given him rest from all his enemies round about, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that the king said unto Nathan the prophet, See now, I dwell in a house of cedar, but the ark of God dwelleth within curtains. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Nathan said to the king, Go, do all that is in thy heart; for Jehovah is with thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass the same night, that the word of Jehovah came unto Nathan, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go and tell my servant David, Thus saith Jehovah, Shalt thou build me a house for me to dwell in? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for I have not dwelt in a house since the day that I brought up the children of Israel out of Egypt, even to this day, but have walked in a tent and in a tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In all places wherein I have walked with all the children of Israel, spake I a word with any of the tribes of Israel, whom I commanded to be shepherd of my people Israel, saying, Why have ye not built me a house of cedar? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore thus shalt thou say unto my servant David, Thus saith Jehovah of hosts, I took thee from the sheepcote, from following the sheep, that thou shouldest be prince over my people, over Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I have been with thee whithersoever thou wentest, and have cut off all thine enemies from before thee; and I will make thee a great name, like unto the name of the great ones that are in the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will appoint a place for my people Israel, and will plant them, that they may dwell in their own place, and be moved no more; neither shall the children of wickedness afflict them any more, as at the first, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " from the day that I commanded judges to be over my people Israel; and I will cause thee to rest from all thine enemies. Moreover Jehovah telleth thee that Jehovah will make thee a house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thy days are fulfilled, and thou shalt sleep with thy fathers, I will set up thy seed after thee, that shall proceed out of thy bowels, and I will establish his kingdom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall build a house for my name, and I will establish the throne of his kingdom for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be his father, and he shall be my son: if he commit iniquity, I will chasten him with the rod of men, and with the stripes of the children of men; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but my lovingkindness shall not depart from him, as I took it from Saul, whom I put away before thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thy house and thy kingdom shall be made sure for ever before thee: thy throne shall be established for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "According to all these words, and according to all this vision, so did Nathan speak unto David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then David the king went in, and sat before Jehovah; and he said, Who am I, O Lord Jehovah, and what is my house, that thou hast brought me thus far? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this was yet a small thing in thine eyes, O Lord Jehovah; but thou hast spoken also of thy servant’s house for a great while to come; and this ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " after the manner of men, O Lord Jehovah! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what can David say more unto thee? for thou knowest thy servant, O Lord Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thy word’s sake, and according to thine own heart, hast thou wrought all this greatness, to make thy servant know it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore thou art great, O Jehovah God: for there is none like thee, neither is there any God besides thee, according to all that we have heard with our ears. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And what one nation in the earth is like thy people, even like Israel, whom God went to redeem unto himself for a people, and to make him a name, and to do great things for you, and terrible things for thy land, before thy people, whom thou redeemedst to thee out of Egypt, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the nations and their gods? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou didst establish to thyself thy people Israel to be a people unto thee for ever; and thou, Jehovah, becamest their God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, O Jehovah God, the word that thou hast spoken concerning thy servant, and concerning his house, confirm thou it for ever, and do as thou hast spoken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let thy name be magnified for ever, saying, Jehovah of hosts is God over Israel; and the house of thy servant David shall be established before thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou, O Jehovah of hosts, the God of Israel, hast revealed to thy servant, saying, I will build thee a house: therefore hath thy servant found in his heart to pray this prayer unto thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, O Lord Jehovah, thou art God, and thy words are truth, and thou hast promised this good thing unto thy servant: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "now therefore let it please thee to bless the house of thy servant, that it may continue for ever before thee; for thou, O Lord Jehovah, hast spoken it: and with thy blessing let the house of thy servant be blessed for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2SA.8",
